{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28244","headline":"隣人自金仙观移竹 · 李远","name":"隣人自金仙观移竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移居新竹已堪看，斸破莓苔得几竿。\n圆节不教伤粉箨，低枝犹拟拂霜坛。\n墙头枝动如烟绿，枕上风来送夜寒。\n第一莫教渔父见，且从萧飒满朱栏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}